# TypeScript incremental build caches. Never commit these: tsc trusts the
# cache over reality, so a checked-in one makes a clean build SKIP emitting
# files it believes are already written — producing a partial dist/ that only
# fails at runtime. This exact file, committed by accident, caused
# "Cannot find module ./prisma-privileged.service" in production.
*.tsbuildinfo
